# Copy to apps/mobile/.env and fill in. EXPO_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the
# shipped bundle and is readable by anyone with the app, exactly as
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* is readable in a browser: the ANON key only, never the
# service-role key, and never a security decision gated on one.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
